<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24521" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-vīso</span></b> , vīsi,
			vīsum, 3, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To look after</i>, <i>inspect
			secretly</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nunc interviso jamne a portu advenerit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Stich. 3, 2, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 2, 90</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Aul. 2, 2, 25</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intervisam, quid faciant coci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 9, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Rud. 2, 7, 34</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ipse crebro interviso,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Q. Fr. 3, 1, 2</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To visit from time to time</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 7, 1, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 24</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
